WEBVTT

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:03.670
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:03.980 --> 00:00:06.000
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.800
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<b>Kinou made no ruuru kyou wa tada no ruuzu</b>

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:20.470
<i>Yesterday’s rules are simply loose today</i>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<b>Kowashite dantotsu gooru</b>

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:24.520
<i>The best goal is to break them</i>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<b>hashiri tudukete nai to</b>

00:00:25.060 --> 00:00:27.560
<i>If I don’t keep running</i>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<b>hokani imi wa nai to</b>

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.940
<i>There’s no other meaning</i>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<b>Panku na tetsukaku nanda</b>

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:34.150
<i>It’s a punk philosophy</i>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<b>Baiorizumu wa tsuubai rizumu de</b>

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:39.330
<i>Biorhythm is a two-time rhythm</i>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<b>Fuukei wa shunkan ni musuu no sen</b>

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.370
<i>The scenery instantly becomes countless lines</i>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<b>Ore wo torimaku kaze</b>

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:46.330
<i>The wind envelops me</i>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.710 --> 00:00:51.050
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.050 --> 00:00:53.420
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:55.430
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:58.140
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.430 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.140 --> 00:01:00.470
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:02.850
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.850 --> 00:01:06.020
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:17.160
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.530 --> 00:01:22.290
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.750
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:28.460
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:40.830
Tanaka's hometown?

00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:45.370
Yeah, it's a small town in the mountains.

00:01:46.750 --> 00:01:50.540
We transfer to a bus here. It'll probably take about another hour.

00:01:50.540 --> 00:01:53.670
What? We have to ride another vehicle?

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:58.050
Part of the fun of camping is the journey on the way to the destination.

00:01:58.680 --> 00:02:01.470
I'm tired of sitting.

00:02:01.550 --> 00:02:03.720
But there's no airport nearby.

00:02:03.720 --> 00:02:05.640
Ah, right there. A little more to the right.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:06.640
Here?

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:13.440
Well, it's nice to travel leisurely by land once in a while.

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:18.280
The river over there is really beautiful and has lots of insects and fish.

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:20.870
That sounds like fun.

00:02:20.990 --> 00:02:24.490
You might be able to swim in the river, Cheese.

00:02:26.080 --> 00:02:30.710
The bus to the Hot Spring Village is... Okay.

00:02:33.710 --> 00:02:36.670
Emergency transmission. Headquarters, do you read me?

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:43.260
Yes, the bus leaves the #3 bus stop for the mountains once an hour.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:44.720
End of transmission.

00:02:47.560 --> 00:02:48.770
Everyone!

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.310
Come here and form a line or you'll miss the bus.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:55.400
Mr. Stewart is really excited.

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:56.280
Yeah.

00:02:56.280 --> 00:03:01.820
In this world, does the teacher always tag along even if you're just going camping with your friends?

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:04.530
No, but he said he had some free time.

00:03:04.700 --> 00:03:11.460
He doesn't have anyone to go out with during vacation time? What a sad life.

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.290
Where's Sonic?

00:03:13.290 --> 00:03:18.380
He doesn't get to come to an island that often, so he's going to completely explore it in a day.

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:30.040
Episode 22

00:03:25.030 --> 00:03:30.040
Summer Vacation! Chao Observation Diary

00:03:33.060 --> 00:03:34.730
How beautiful.

00:03:56.040 --> 00:03:57.960
Tanaka, we're here.

00:03:59.210 --> 00:04:01.130
I've been waiting for you.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:04.010
Did you finish visiting your ancestors' grave?

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:10.980
I've asked them to watch over you and Sonic and his friends.

00:04:11.480 --> 00:04:12.850
Thank you.

00:04:16.150 --> 00:04:18.820
Where are we going to camp?

00:04:18.820 --> 00:04:20.820
I'll show you.

00:04:20.940 --> 00:04:23.110
Oh, wait!

00:04:24.610 --> 00:04:28.660
I'll serve as your guide. Let's go, everyone!

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:30.950
This way!

00:04:31.950 --> 00:04:34.870
The air smells great.

00:04:35.370 --> 00:04:37.420
The sky is very beautiful.

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:42.300
Of course. It's Tanaka's hometown. I'm glad that you all like it.

00:04:42.300 --> 00:04:46.090
It's really wonderful, right Cheese?

00:04:58.690 --> 00:05:00.980
Hey, aren't you Sonic?

00:05:00.980 --> 00:05:03.690
I watch your feats on TV all the time.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:06.740
I'm so happy to meet you in person.

00:05:06.740 --> 00:05:08.570
You can say that again.

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:10.870
Oh, how embarrassing!

00:05:14.290 --> 00:05:16.500
What's this?

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:19.750
I'm sorry. I'm not good at cooking.

00:05:22.250 --> 00:05:24.880
Mr. Tanaka, you're very skilled.

00:05:25.170 --> 00:05:26.470
I guess.

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:30.260
Mr. Stewart, can you skewer these and place them in a line?

00:05:30.260 --> 00:05:31.350
Sure.

00:05:32.220 --> 00:05:33.970
This I can handle.

00:05:35.600 --> 00:05:39.480
It's only been months since the public found out about Sonic and his friends.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:42.230
To think that I can go camping with them...

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:43.230
- Put the sliced vegetables in here.

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:43.860
Sure.

00:05:44.530 --> 00:05:47.110
This isn't bad.

00:05:49.780 --> 00:05:51.870
Aww, it flew away.

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:59.460
Wow! It curled itself into a ball, like Sonic! Let's take this insect home with us.

00:05:59.580 --> 00:06:02.250
I don't want pillbug specimens.

00:06:02.340 --> 00:06:03.460
Yeah.

00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.170
Really?

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.380
Wow! Cream, look!

00:06:08.550 --> 00:06:09.550
There are fish.

00:06:09.550 --> 00:06:12.260
You're right!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:13.760
Wait!

00:06:13.850 --> 00:06:15.310
It flew.

00:06:17.810 --> 00:06:19.850
Don't go that way!

00:06:20.980 --> 00:06:22.360
Cheese!

00:06:23.730 --> 00:06:25.150
Cheese!

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.990
Wait, Cream!

00:06:26.990 --> 00:06:29.660
Cream, we have to tell the others first!

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.240
He didn't come this way.

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:40.080
Just a little way up from here, the river divides in two.

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:42.880
Maybe Cheese drifted in the other direction.

00:06:43.670 --> 00:06:45.000
Cheese!

00:06:45.130 --> 00:06:50.380
Cheese is a good swimmer, so he won't drown. Don't worry.

00:06:50.680 --> 00:06:52.430
Amy's right.

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.180
Yes.

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:57.310
I'm sorry. I was with them, but...

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:59.600
It's not your fault, Francis.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:00.480
Yeah.

00:07:00.980 --> 00:07:05.570
Although the current is fast, there are some pools and pockets of still water.

00:07:05.650 --> 00:07:08.860
There's a good chance that he will stop in one of those.

00:07:08.860 --> 00:07:11.280
I'm sure of it! Let's go find him.

00:07:11.660 --> 00:07:14.830
Okay, begin Operation Find Cheese!

00:07:14.950 --> 00:07:16.290
Yeah!

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:26.800
I'm exhausted.

00:07:31.970 --> 00:07:36.010
Why is this country so hot and humid?

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:40.180
Humidity is now is at 80%.

00:07:40.180 --> 00:07:42.100
The temperature is 35 degrees Celsius.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.440
This is the worst season for taking a vacation.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:48.230
This trip isn't a vacation. It's more like a training exercise.

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:52.110
Be quiet! You had your chance to complain!

00:07:52.320 --> 00:07:55.820
Decoe, chair! Bocoe, fan!

00:07:56.660 --> 00:07:59.500
Here you go. I'll wipe off your sweat.

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:00.620
Fan.

00:08:03.250 --> 00:08:09.340
Dr. Eggman, let's end this vacation and go back to Egg Fort II.

00:08:09.340 --> 00:08:14.640
No. I'm not leaving this country until I can go home with good memories.

00:08:14.970 --> 00:08:19.970
I understand how you feel. All your recent confrontations with Sonic have ended in failure.

00:08:19.970 --> 00:08:23.600
Furthermore, you haven't even gotten one Chaos Emerald.

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.350
Shut up!

00:08:30.730 --> 00:08:34.860
Why are you the only one who's enjoying this trip?

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:39.740
Nothing wrong with that. Anyway, I found something interesting!

00:08:43.540 --> 00:08:48.290
Cheese!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:51.380
If you're there, please answer!

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.670
Those guys are also here.

00:08:53.760 --> 00:08:55.550
They're looking for something.

00:08:55.550 --> 00:08:58.100
Could it be the Chaos Emerald?

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.560
What!

00:08:59.560 --> 00:09:01.020
They'll see us.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:04.230
I'm sure that Sonic is also nearby.

00:09:05.600 --> 00:09:10.570
I won't let them have it. The Chaos Emerald is mine!

00:09:11.820 --> 00:09:13.610
Cheese!

00:09:14.740 --> 00:09:20.030
Cheese!

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:28.290
Why do I have to deal with all this trouble?

00:09:28.380 --> 00:09:30.540
It must be hard to be human.

00:09:30.540 --> 00:09:31.460
Yeah.

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:35.720
It's not fair that you guys don't get itchy.

00:09:35.720 --> 00:09:38.220
It's not our fault.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:41.260
Behind you.

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:52.400
So itchy!

00:09:55.650 --> 00:09:58.570
How dare they!

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.660
Did you hear someone just now?

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:03.080
Was it Cheese?

00:10:03.080 --> 00:10:05.540
No, it was a man's voice.

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:08.170
Then it probably has nothing to do with us.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:08.960
Right.

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.590
Cheese!

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:12.960
Where are you?

00:10:13.750 --> 00:10:16.300
Is Cheese on the other side?

00:10:16.300 --> 00:10:17.670
Probably.

00:10:21.470 --> 00:10:23.430
It's too small for me.

00:10:23.430 --> 00:10:28.100
We'll go inside. Wait here, Mr. Stewart.

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.190
Fine, but be careful.

00:10:31.190 --> 00:10:32.270
Okay.

00:10:35.780 --> 00:10:38.150
If anything happens, come back right away.

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.570
Okay.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.250
Good. The signal is strong.

00:11:00.630 --> 00:11:01.890
Wow!

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:07.770
Wow!

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:08.930
Huh?

00:11:08.930 --> 00:11:10.690
Sonic!

00:11:10.980 --> 00:11:13.060
Would you like a taste?

00:11:13.690 --> 00:11:14.610
Thank you.

00:11:14.650 --> 00:11:16.940
Oh, Sonic!

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.740
Do you like it?

00:11:18.990 --> 00:11:20.200
It's good!

00:11:23.410 --> 00:11:26.160
We're finally at the exit.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:28.080
What?

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.960
This is…

00:11:43.090 --> 00:11:45.180
This is…

00:11:50.810 --> 00:11:52.980
There are so many Chao!

00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:56.150
So they're also living in this world.

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:57.690
Cheese!

00:11:59.530 --> 00:12:02.030
They're so cute.

00:12:03.700 --> 00:12:05.990
They're not afraid of humans?

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:10.540
Since not many people come here, I guess they're not instinctually afraid of humans.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:13.790
This really is a beautiful place.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.630
Cheese!

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:20.590
Cheese? No, you're not him.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.300
Cheese? No.

00:12:25.430 --> 00:12:26.680
Cheese!

00:12:26.890 --> 00:12:28.470
Cheese!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.640
Cheese, I'm so glad.

00:12:33.440 --> 00:12:38.690
Thank goodness. Cream, you're soaking wet after hugging him.

00:12:38.690 --> 00:12:42.030
I don't mind because I know that Cheese is safe.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:44.150
Isn't this great, Cream?

00:12:44.150 --> 00:12:45.200
Yes.

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:47.240
Isn't this great, Cheese?

00:12:49.200 --> 00:12:50.160
What's going on?

00:12:50.160 --> 00:12:52.410
Everybody looks happy.

00:12:52.500 --> 00:12:57.170
It's like they're saying that they're happy that Cheese was able to meet his friends.

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:58.920
You can understand them, Chris?

00:12:58.920 --> 00:13:02.380
I don't understand what they're saying. But sort of.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:04.970
Thank you.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:07.800
Yes, it sure looks that way.

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:16.190
Sonic!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:19.900
Hi girls! Hello! Hi!

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:25.950
I couldn't get a picture of him.

00:13:29.490 --> 00:13:30.660
Here goes!

00:13:31.910 --> 00:13:33.450
Nice catch!

00:13:36.540 --> 00:13:37.540
Here you go.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:41.040
They're eating.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:45.260
Tails, do the Chao live in places similar to here in your world?

00:13:45.720 --> 00:13:50.760
Yeah. Chao can only live in places where the water is clean.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:56.020
But even in our world, the number of places where the Chao can live is decreasing.

00:13:56.980 --> 00:13:59.730
That's why they're specially protected.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:05.490
It's the same in this world. This is the first time I've seen Chao in the wild.

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.240
This may have been a secret place.

00:14:15.450 --> 00:14:18.290
We've lost track of them.

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:22.630
Dr. Eggman, let‘s give up and go home.

00:14:22.630 --> 00:14:26.130
I'm done with this!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:31.350
Geniuses like myself aren't suited for the mountains!

00:14:33.720 --> 00:14:35.520
He has no physical stamina.

00:14:35.520 --> 00:14:39.900
That's because he always stays in his room with the air conditioner on.

00:14:39.900 --> 00:14:43.110
Decoe, take out the object inside the knapsack.

00:14:43.110 --> 00:14:44.520
Yes, sir.

00:14:47.280 --> 00:14:49.450
Oh!

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:57.910
<i>What the heck? I can't believe I had to carry this around!</i>

00:14:52.820 --> 00:14:57.910
I had this ready, just in case. The Mecha Choice Slot Machine.

00:15:01.170 --> 00:15:03.590
Pull the lever…

00:15:06.050 --> 00:15:11.340
Okay! Come on right now, E-66!

00:15:32.740 --> 00:15:35.410
I should've gone with them.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:37.790
They'll be fine.

00:15:38.080 --> 00:15:44.170
I'm embarrassed to admit it, but when I was a child, I used to run around the mountains everyday.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:48.960
I can't imagine you as a child, Tanaka.

00:15:49.090 --> 00:15:54.390
I have an idea where Cheese is. He's probably deep in those mountains.

00:15:54.390 --> 00:15:58.270
Hey! Are they back yet?

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:00.560
What are you doing here, Mr. Stewart?

00:16:00.730 --> 00:16:06.570
There was a tunnel along the way that was too small for adults. I was waiting outside but…

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:07.900
How strange.

00:16:07.900 --> 00:16:09.690
What's the problem?

00:16:09.780 --> 00:16:17.990
To be safe, I was tracing Chris's position. However, I lost track because of interference.

00:16:17.990 --> 00:16:20.040
That's not good!

00:16:29.960 --> 00:16:31.550
Eggman!

00:16:33.930 --> 00:16:35.680
See you again.

00:16:43.190 --> 00:16:44.940
Bye bye!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:53.400
Cheese, you're feeling lonely.

00:16:53.950 --> 00:16:56.280
Let's come here again next year.

00:16:56.280 --> 00:17:01.790
I'm going to bring a basketball next time so that we can form teams and play.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.460
Yes! Right, Cheese?

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:07.920
What's that?

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:19.390
I found you kids.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:20.850
Eggman!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:31.190
Cough it up! Where's the Chao Emerald?

00:17:31.190 --> 00:17:33.150
Chaos Emerald?

00:17:33.150 --> 00:17:34.530
What are you talking about?

00:17:34.530 --> 00:17:42.040
There's no point in hiding it! I know you were searching for it in the mountains!

00:17:42.160 --> 00:17:42.910
What?

00:17:42.910 --> 00:17:47.210
He must have seen us searching for Cheese and misunderstanding our actions.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.460
Gee, give us a break.

00:17:49.460 --> 00:17:52.840
We don't know anything about the Chaos Emerald!

00:17:52.840 --> 00:17:53.760
Ouch!

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:56.380
Stop playing dumb.

00:17:56.680 --> 00:17:58.930
Calm down, Dr. Eggman.

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:01.100
Let me wipe off your sweat.

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:07.730
Children who don't behave must be punished. Go, E-66!

00:18:29.790 --> 00:18:31.960
What's with him?

00:18:31.960 --> 00:18:37.010
The mecha was too heavy. The soil here is soft.

00:18:37.010 --> 00:18:39.880
That's what he gets for having no consideration for time, place and occasion.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:43.640
The river water is dirty!

00:18:45.100 --> 00:18:48.810
This is bad! The Chao's oasis will become dirty!

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.690
Let's hurry back to the oasis!

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:51.610
Okay!

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:56.280
What a fragile mountain.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:01.490
E-66 is not suited for tiny islands.

00:19:01.870 --> 00:19:04.490
So it won't go as smoothly as if we were on a continent.

00:19:04.490 --> 00:19:10.790
Shut up! Let's move to flat land and start over.

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:18.260
Cleaning complete!

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:20.470
All right, let's start it up again!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:21.720
Dr. Eggman?

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.850
That.

00:19:24.760 --> 00:19:26.220
What are you doing?

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:33.190
Sonic! Umm, we're on vacation! Right?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.020
Right.

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.440
Exactly.

00:19:39.110 --> 00:19:41.910
A vacation?

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:50.620
Honest! We've been in a slump recently, so we thought it would be good to relax in a foreign land.

00:19:50.620 --> 00:19:52.250
That's right.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.420
Now!

00:19:58.510 --> 00:19:59.800
He vanished!

00:20:00.220 --> 00:20:01.380
I'm over here.

00:20:01.590 --> 00:20:05.390
I don't know what you're planning, but it can't be good.

00:20:06.970 --> 00:20:08.600
Goodbye!

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:22.610
Stop us!

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.410
Sonic!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:32.500
Sonic, Eggman's mecha is...

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:34.870
You defeated it already?

00:20:34.870 --> 00:20:35.830
Yeah.

00:20:35.920 --> 00:20:40.380
Chris and the others aren't back yet. I hope they didn't get caught up in anything bad.

00:20:40.510 --> 00:20:41.720
Okay.

00:20:41.720 --> 00:20:43.260
Hold this for me.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:56.860
Okay. Use this to carry the mud.

00:20:57.230 --> 00:20:59.020
This will take forever.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:03.070
But Chao can't survive unless the water is clean.

00:21:03.070 --> 00:21:07.120
That's right. We can't give up. We all have to work hard.

00:21:07.120 --> 00:21:09.240
That's right! Exactly!

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:12.410
So all I have to do is remove the mud.

00:21:12.410 --> 00:21:13.790
Sonic!

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:15.960
Everyone, step away from the oasis.

00:21:19.540 --> 00:21:20.630
Here I go!

00:21:49.070 --> 00:21:51.240
Okay! All done!

00:21:55.410 --> 00:21:57.170
Thank you, Sonic!

00:21:57.170 --> 00:21:58.790
I got you all dirty.

00:21:59.210 --> 00:22:01.000
We're all muddy!

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.670
I have to take a shower.

00:22:02.670 --> 00:22:04.550
Sonic, are you all right?

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.130
Don't worry.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:10.390
It's beautiful.

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:11.010
Awesome!

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:13.220
How pretty.

00:22:16.640 --> 00:22:20.270
You knew about the Chao's oasis, didn't you?

00:22:20.480 --> 00:22:24.730
That area was like my own backyard, so…

00:22:24.980 --> 00:22:30.570
All the Chao are safe because Sonic cleaned the water.

00:22:30.820 --> 00:22:33.200
That's great.

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:45.090 --> 00:22:54.510
<i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<b>Ai suru to kime kisae namida ni ujirareteru</b>

00:22:54.510 --> 00:23:03.480
<i>The nervousness of love is sealed by tears.</i>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<b>Boy boy futari de jumon wo sagashi ni ikou</b>

00:23:03.480 --> 00:23:12.370
<i>Boy, let’s search for a spell together,</i>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<b>Kinji rareta yume wo kanaerareru kuni he</b>

00:23:12.370 --> 00:23:21.960
<i>To a land where our forbidden dreams can come true.</i>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<b>Dare ni mo naisho de ashita na tchi awaseshiyou</b>

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:30.930
<i>Let’s secretly meet tomorrow.</i>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<b>Itsuka kotori wo ume ta yowake no mieru oka de</b>

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:41.100
<i>At the place where we buried the bird, the hill where we can see the sunrise.</i>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<b>Tsumetai asamoya kimi to te wo tsunaidara</b>

00:23:41.690 --> 00:23:49.860
<i>In the cold morning mist, if I hold hands with you.</i>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<b>Hikaru michi no fuuin ga tokeru yo</b>

00:23:50.610 --> 00:23:59.040
<i>The seal to the shining path will be broken.</i>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<b>Hateshinaku</b>

00:23:59.560 --> 00:24:03.880
<i>Forever...</i>

00:24:29.090 --> 00:25:35.430
Mayhem! 6 Chaos Emeralds
